FiveIsland_ResortGorgeous_Text_DaisyIntro::
    .string "Com estas mãos, vou criar\n"
    .string "a minha vitória!$"

FiveIsland_ResortGorgeous_Text_DaisyDefeat::
    .string "Que vergonha…\n"
    .string "Estou vermelha de vergonha…$"

FiveIsland_ResortGorgeous_Text_DaisyPostBattle::
    .string "Ai, meus tubos de tinta\n"
    .string "se espalharam por toda parte!$"

FiveIsland_ResortGorgeous_Text_CelinaIntro::
    .string "Com licença!\n"
    .string "Estou tentando pintar.\l"
    .string "Por favor, saia da minha vista!$"

FiveIsland_ResortGorgeous_Text_CelinaDefeat::
    .string "Esta derrota…\n"
    .string "Me deu um branco…$"

FiveIsland_ResortGorgeous_Text_CelinaPostBattle::
    .string "Gillian?\n"
    .string "Incline a cabeça um pouquinho…\l"
    .string "Isso! É esse o olhar que eu quero!$"

FiveIsland_ResortGorgeous_Text_RaynaIntro::
    .string "Hmm…\n"
    .string "O ângulo… não está bem certo…$"

FiveIsland_ResortGorgeous_Text_RaynaDefeat::
    .string "Ah…\n"
    .string "Meus sentimentos… estão cinzentos…$"

FiveIsland_ResortGorgeous_Text_RaynaPostBattle::
    .string "O céu e o mar…\n"
    .string "São tão inconstantes.\p"
    .string "As expressões mudam sem parar,\n"
    .string "e é difícil capturá-las.$"

FiveIsland_ResortGorgeous_Text_JackiIntro::
    .string "Estou visitando o refúgio da minha\n"
    .string "amiga, se quer mesmo saber.$"

FiveIsland_ResortGorgeous_Text_JackiDefeat::
    .string "Ora, ora, que forte.$"

FiveIsland_ResortGorgeous_Text_JackiPostBattle::
    .string "Acho um prazer batalhar sem pressa\n"
    .string "na suave brisa do mar.$"

FiveIsland_ResortGorgeous_Text_GillianIntro::
    .string "Estou pensando em mandar construir\n"
    .string "uma piscina só para Pokémon.$"

FiveIsland_ResortGorgeous_Text_GillianDefeat::
    .string "Ai, meu Deus do céu!$"

FiveIsland_ResortGorgeous_Text_GillianPostBattle::
    .string "Uma piscina seria bom, mas devo\n"
    .string "dizer que um solário seria sublime.$"

FiveIsland_ResortGorgeous_Text_DestinIntro::
    .string "Eu corro bem.\n"
    .string "Sou muito rápido!$"

FiveIsland_ResortGorgeous_Text_DestinDefeat::
    .string "Ops!\n"
    .string "Acelerei demais!$"

FiveIsland_ResortGorgeous_Text_DestinPostBattle::
    .string "Quando corro com o vento, sinto\n"
    .string "que posso voar!$"

FiveIsland_ResortGorgeous_Text_TobyIntro::
    .string "Devo dizer que a vida marinha deste\n"
    .string "resort me agrada muito.$"

FiveIsland_ResortGorgeous_Text_TobyDefeat::
    .string "Que choque!\n"
    .string "Você só pode estar brincando.$"

FiveIsland_ResortGorgeous_Text_TobyPostBattle::
    .string "Levar isso tão a sério…\n"
    .string "Que absurdo.$"

FiveIsland_ResortGorgeous_Text_SelphyThanksYouMayGoNow::
    .string "Selphy: Obrigada.\p"
    .string "Pode ir agora.$"

FiveIsland_ResortGorgeous_Text_SelphysHouse::
    .string "Casa da Selphy$"

